# Edgar, King of Figaro's FlipCoinMod (StaticAbilityFlipCoinMod.java:14-19)
# fixes the result while Count$YouFlipThisTurn is 0: Winter Sky's flip, the
# human's first this turn, asks no call and is won (FlipCoinEffect.java:
# 203-221), so it deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 R
castspell human 1
resolvestack
